    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109170" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσπᾰνίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, used by Trag. only in pf.
		part., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be
				scant</i> or <i>stinted of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεσπανισμένοι βορᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					489
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				577
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>to be lacking, to be left undone,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί δ᾽ ἐστὶ χρείας τῆσδ᾽
			ὑπεσπανισμένον</span> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.4
				</span></i>
			) <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				740
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			 in signf. <i><span class="en">
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				2.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.25
			</span></i>; in signf. <i><span class="en">
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.64
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				73
			</span></i>.</div>
